<title>CANADA: Derlan wins C$15 mln U.S. aerospace order.</title>
<headline>Derlan wins C$15 mln U.S. aerospace order.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derlan Industries Ltd said on Tuesday its California-based subsidiary, Derlan Inc, was awarded a contract worth about C$16 million from Sino Swearingen Aircraft Co to produce landing gear for the new SJ30-2 business jet.</p>
<p>Derlan said it would provide landing gear systems on an exclusive basis to Sino Swearingen for the life of the SJ30-2 program.</p>
<p>Deliveries are slated to begin in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
